Welcome to fielddEDU, the free learning series that helps you master running your business.

In this quick tutorial, we’ll show you how to set up and launch your online booking page using Fieldd’s customer portal. Learn how to customize the portal’s branding, install it via direct link, embed, or QR code, and enable powerful features like intake forms, customer assets, and cancellation policies. Fieldd helps you deliver a fully automated booking experience that feels personal and professional.

When you’re ready to master your business, we’re here to help: https://fieldd.co

